{"page":260,"verses":[{"verse_key":"14:34","surah":14,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَءَاتَىٰكُم مِّن كُلِّ مَا سَأَلْتُمُوهُ ۚ وَإِن تَعُدُّوا۟ نِعْمَتَ ٱللَّهِ لَا تُحْصُوهَآ ۗ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ لَظَلُومٌ كَفَّارٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and given you some of everything you asked Him for. If you tried to count God’s favours you could never calculate them: man is truly unjust and ungrateful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَءَاتَىٰكُم","en_gloss":"And He gave you","transliteration":"waātākum","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"all","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَأَلْتُمُوهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"you asked of Him","transliteration":"sa-altumūhu","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَعُدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"you count","transliteration":"taʿuddū","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نِعْمَتَ","en_gloss":"(the) Favor of Allah","transliteration":"niʿ'mata","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(the) Favor of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تُحْصُوهَآ ۗ","en_gloss":"you will (be able to) count them","transliteration":"tuḥ'ṣūhā","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"the mankind","transliteration":"l-insāna","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَظَلُومٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) surely unjust","transliteration":"laẓalūmun","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَفَّارٌۭ","en_gloss":"(and) ungrateful","transliteration":"kaffārun","verse_key":"14:34"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:34"}]},{"verse_key":"14:35","surah":14,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ قَالَ إِبْرَٰهِيمُ رَبِّ ٱجْعَلْ هَـٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدَ ءَامِنًا وَٱجْنُبْنِى وَبَنِىَّ أَن نَّعْبُدَ ٱلْأَصْنَامَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember when Abraham said, ‘Lord, make this town safe! Preserve me and my offspring from idolatry,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīmu","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱجْعَلْ","en_gloss":"Make","transliteration":"ij'ʿal","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْبَلَدَ","en_gloss":"city","transliteration":"l-balada","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ءَامِنًۭا","en_gloss":"safe","transliteration":"āminan","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱجْنُبْنِى","en_gloss":"and keep me away","transliteration":"wa-uj'nub'nī","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَبَنِىَّ","en_gloss":"and my sons","transliteration":"wabaniyya","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَّعْبُدَ","en_gloss":"we worship","transliteration":"naʿbuda","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْأَصْنَامَ","en_gloss":"the idols","transliteration":"l-aṣnāma","verse_key":"14:35"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:35"}]},{"verse_key":"14:36","surah":14,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"رَبِّ إِنَّهُنَّ أَضْلَلْنَ كَثِيرًا مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ ۖ فَمَن تَبِعَنِى فَإِنَّهُۥ مِنِّى ۖ وَمَنْ عَصَانِى فَإِنَّكَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Lord, the [idols] have led many people astray! Anyone who follows me is with me, but as for anyone who disobeys me- You are surely forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّهُنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahunna","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَضْلَلْنَ","en_gloss":"have led astray","transliteration":"aḍlalna","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"many","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"So whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَبِعَنِى","en_gloss":"follows me","transliteration":"tabiʿanī","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"then indeed, he","transliteration":"fa-innahu","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنِّى ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) of me","transliteration":"minnī","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَصَانِى","en_gloss":"disobeys me","transliteration":"ʿaṣānī","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَإِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"then indeed, You","transliteration":"fa-innaka","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"14:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:36"}]},{"verse_key":"14:37","surah":14,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"رَّبَّنَآ إِنِّىٓ أَسْكَنتُ مِن ذُرِّيَّتِى بِوَادٍ غَيْرِ ذِى زَرْعٍ عِندَ بَيْتِكَ ٱلْمُحَرَّمِ رَبَّنَا لِيُقِيمُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ فَٱجْعَلْ أَفْـِٔدَةً مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ تَهْوِىٓ إِلَيْهِمْ وَٱرْزُقْهُم مِّنَ ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَشْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Our Lord, I have established some of my offspring in an uncultivated valley, close to Your Sacred House, Lord, so that they may keep up the prayer. Make people’s hearts turn to them, and provide them with produce, so that they may be thankful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَّبَّنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَسْكَنتُ","en_gloss":"[I] have settled","transliteration":"askantu","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(some) of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ذُرِّيَّتِى","en_gloss":"my offsprings","transliteration":"dhurriyyatī","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِوَادٍ","en_gloss":"in a valley","transliteration":"biwādin","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"غَيْرِ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"ghayri","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ذِى","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"dhī","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"زَرْعٍ","en_gloss":"cultivation","transliteration":"zarʿin","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"near","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَيْتِكَ","en_gloss":"Your Sacred House","transliteration":"baytika","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْمُحَرَّمِ","en_gloss":"Your Sacred House","transliteration":"l-muḥarami","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَبَّنَا","en_gloss":"our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِيُقِيمُوا۟","en_gloss":"That they may establish","transliteration":"liyuqīmū","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the prayers","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَٱجْعَلْ","en_gloss":"So make","transliteration":"fa-ij'ʿal","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَفْـِٔدَةًۭ","en_gloss":"hearts","transliteration":"afidatan","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"14:37"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the men","transliteration":"l-nās